{"name":"mcp__codex_apps__lobu_query_sql","description":"Enables searching and managing a structured workspace knowledge graph, including entities, schemas, connections, feeds, operations, classifiers, and stored content. Also supports defining and orchestrating “watchers” that run LLM-based analyses over synced data, including windowed execution, external LLM processing, automated reaction scripts, and feedback-driven schema-corrected extractions.

